cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the EchoDrift data, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "EchoDrift atlas of phonetic shifts"
abstract: >-
  An open dataset of phonetic shifts (sound changes and allophones) between
  pairs of IPA sounds, documented across world languages. Each shift lists word
  examples from an attested ancestor to its descendant, the language family,
  certainty and commonality scores, and its sources.
authors:
  - name: "EchoDrift Contributors"
url: "https://echodrift.lipu.dev"
repository-code: "https://github.com/komapc/phonomorph"
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - sound change
  - historical linguistics
  - phonology
  - IPA
  - allophony
